title: "vp_wave_computer — a wave-substrate computer toward functional general intelligence"
abstract: >-
  A long-horizon theory-track research program building a clock-free wave-substrate
  computer in which information is carried by oscillator phase and computation is the
  physics settling to a fixed point. Layers L0-L9 are stacked toward at-least-human-level
  FUNCTIONAL intelligence, under a permanent firewall (consciousness_claim = 0,
  hard_problem_open = 1) that treats the hard problem of consciousness as an explicit,
  never-erased blank. Every layer is graded [V]/[L]/[O] and every claim must survive a
  test designed to break it; honest negatives are recorded, not tuned away.
